      "writtenOn": "2023-02-16T20:35:48Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The local dispatch size definitely factors into it but the exact dimensions are hard to predict without knowing about the algorithm. For instance, a ComputeStep that processes a path stream may choose a one-dimensional layout whereas an image operation might prefer a 2D workgroup layout. Others might prefer to process everything in a single workgroup with multiple iterations. This is why I made this a dynamic query.",
      "parentUuid": "c55b25c1_7e3b463a",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 153,
        "startChar": 26,
        "endLine": 153,
        "endChar": 53
      },
      "revId": "4b9b7c2aa1a1647545d45d531859734a45c94ff6",
